<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: mutation - Elder Direwolf -->
  <EGO_Mutation_Elder_Direwolf.label>突变 - 古老恐狼</EGO_Mutation_Elder_Direwolf.label>
  <!-- EN: Mutation is an amalgam-technological adaptation that alters the Symbiote, strengthening its bond with the host and granting enhanced abilities. It was developed from a mutated EGO Seed harvested from an Elder Direwolf.\n\nImplantation requires - symbiont.\n\nThis mutation can be implanted up to 5 times to increase its effect. -->
  <EGO_Mutation_Elder_Direwolf.description>突变是一种融合技术适应性改造，能够改变共生体，增强其与宿主的结合并赋予增强能力。它是由从古老恐狼身上收获的变异EGO种子开发而来的。\n\n植入需要 - 共生体。\n\n这种突变最多可植入5次以增强效果。</EGO_Mutation_Elder_Direwolf.description>
  <!-- EN: Implant {0_label} -->
  <EGO_Mutation_Elder_Direwolf.comps.CompUsableImplant.useLabel>植入{0_label}</EGO_Mutation_Elder_Direwolf.comps.CompUsableImplant.useLabel>
  
